 "remarks": "With a total renovation completed in 2024, this pristine, airy gem offers both privacy and convenience. Beautiful, professionally-landscaped grounds, including a waterfall. Two wall-mounted TVs included. The 30X13 deck with a sylvan vista features an electric retractable awning and built-in propane grill. Large carpeted walk-up attic off the front hall. Dining area chandelier negotiable. Backup generator. Third garage is tandem. Separate locked basement storage with external access for owner's use. Credit/reference check. First month's rent and one month's security.",
